Third-party components
----------------------

- packages/fjs and the vendored fjs/FRB/cargokit code: MIT license, kept in
  packages/fjs/LICENSE and the vendored subdirectories.
- QuickJS, vendored under packages/fjs/libfjs/vendor/rquickjs-sys/quickjs for the
  patched rquickjs-sys build: MIT license, copyright Fabrice Bellard and Charlie
  Gordon.
- Dart and Flutter package dependencies: see pubspec.lock for the exact versions
  and each package's own license.
- Rust crate dependencies of packages/fjs/libfjs and packages/fjs/liber_text: see
  their Cargo.lock files; the crate licenses are recorded by the crates
  themselves.
- The Chinese conversion tables in packages/fjs/liber_text/assets/hanlp-tc
  (t2s.txt, s2t.txt): from HanLP 1.x's data/dictionary/tc, Apache-2.0, copyright
  Hankcs; those files are themselves text conversions of OpenCC's dictionaries
  (Apache-2.0). assets/hanlp-tc/PROVENANCE.md records the revision and hashes.
- Legado's `fixT2sDict` word list, reproduced in
  packages/fjs/liber_text/src/convert.rs as behavioural data: 38 words the frozen
  reader keeps verbatim.

The Book Source compatibility baseline this project measures against is a
separate work (Legado, GPL-3.0-or-later). Nothing in this repository is derived
from its source code; it is only executed as a black-box oracle by harnesses,
and those harnesses that link against its classes are kept in the private
liber-archive repository rather than here.
